# W10b, guest b (k2): joins a in stag0101, walks into the enemies and falls; a removes it while it is defeated: HOME takes
# exactly its slot (ForkKind::home, defeated or not), so b goes home (no game over, no stay), on its own story.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b in stag0101
follow 40 until sealed>=600
log b joined a
die until dead
log b defeated
idle until stage=stagml11 fail epoch>=@480
log b home while defeated
idle until frames>=240 fail key:4=1
log own story at home
